-- ContrataCR Pro, database part 15 of 21 (PRO_ENABLED stays false: nothing here turns Pro on).
-- Generated by scripts/pro/build-pro-migrations.mjs from the ordered local SQL manifest (scripts/pro/local-sql-manifest.mjs);
-- do not edit by hand: change docs/pro/sql and regenerate. Every module is idempotent (create if not exists / or replace /
-- guarded blocks) and keeps its own RLS, grants (service_role only unless stated) and pinned search_path.
-- Modules, in order:
--   connectors-local.sql sha256:167253db78af
--   accounting-sync-local.sql sha256:9ead26f65de7
--   ai-assistant-local.sql sha256:ed3bcb5a33d4
--   esign-acceptance-local.sql sha256:21158fb8d8a7
--   calendar-autosync-local.sql sha256:1d0a714a1fc4
--   marketing-providers-local.sql sha256:de397df8e274
